ble beating card (♣5) supports team tempo without overcommitting.\n\nReason:  \nPlay ♣5 to continue the ascending single card sequence initiated by my teammate (♥4), maintaining pressure on the landlord while conserving stronger cards (like the bomb, high singles) for critical moments later. This supports cooperation and avoids wasting high cards unnecessarily.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♣5"]}'}
